<p>In May 1919, his fellow veterans in the process of establishing an American Legion post in Mandan, voted to name it after him. Upon hearing of the honor, his former commander sent a letter dated June 29, 1919 to post commander Hugo Rendon from his then current billet at the Headquarters of the Army's 1st Division in Montebauer, Germany.</p>

